10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 610.1193307086614368 Td
(Phase 2: Curriculum Mapping & Alignment — Faculty map PEOs to PLOs with weighted correlation factors \(Strong, Moderate,) Tj
T* (Low\), and map Course CLOs to PLOs.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
