39.6850393700787407 580.6390157480313974 Td
(Phase 3: Assessment Authoring & Question Blueprinting — Instructors create midterms, finals, and lab projects, mapping each) Tj
T* (specific question to an intended CLO and Bloom cognitive level \(e.g. Q1 -> CLO-1 C4\).) Tj
