BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 164.9413779527557153 Td
(Individual Student CLO Score \(%\): For a given student and CLO, the score is the ratio of obtained marks to maximum marks) Tj
T* (across all questions mapped to that CLO:) Tj
T* (Score_CLO = \(Sum\(obtainedMarks_q\) / Sum\(maxMarks_q\)\) * 100) Tj
T* (A student achieves the CLO if Score_CLO >= studentPassThresholdPct \(Configured default: 50%\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 111.6500393700785025 Td
(Cohort CLO Attainment Percentage \(%\): The proportion of assessed enrolled students who met the individual pass criterion:) Tj
T* (Attainment_CLO = \(Count\(Students Meeting Pass Criterion\) / Count\(Eligible Assessed Students\)\) * 100) Tj
T* (The cohort meets the CLO if Attainment_CLO >= cohortKpiTargetPct \(Configured default: 50%\). Note that this percentage is) Tj
T* (mathematically distinct from the class average score!) Tj
ET
