(2. Program Learning Outcome \(PLO\) Direct, Indirect & Combined Attainment) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 771.0238582677164914 Td
(Combined PLO Attainment Formula:) Tj
T* (A_combined = w_direct * A_direct + w_indirect * A_indirect) Tj
T* (where w_direct + w_indirect = 1.0 \(or 100%\). In accordance with PEC/HEC standards, weights default to 80% direct and 20%) Tj
T* (indirect, or can be configured to 70/30 or other statutory ratios.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
39.6850393700787407 717.7325196850393922 Td
(3. The RBRI Metric: Risk-Based Remediation Index) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 703.559291338582625 Td
(In this codebase, RBRI \(Risk-Based Remediation Index / Risk-Based Retention Index\) represents a multi-factor diagnostic) Tj
T* (indicator computed for every enrolled student. It synthesizes academic marks performance, lecture attendance consistency, and) Tj
T* (failed prerequisite CLO counts to classify students into actionable risk tiers \(HIGH RISK, MEDIUM RISK, LOW RISK\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 662.1734645669291695 Td
(RBRI Mathematical Derivation:) Tj
T* (RBRI_Score = 0.45 * \(100 - AvgMarks\) + 0.35 * \(100 - AttendancePct\) + 0.20 * \(FailedCLOCount * 25\)) Tj
T* (Where:) Tj
T* (- RBRI >= 50 or Attendance < 75%: Flagged as HIGH RISK \(debared from exam / urgent remedial advising\)) Tj
T* (- 30 <= RBRI < 50: Flagged as MEDIUM RISK \(watchlist / supplemental tutoring\)) Tj
T* (- RBRI < 30: Flagged as LOW RISK \(satisfactory good standing\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
39.6850393700787407 585.0711023622047833 Td
(4. Independent Attendance Eligibility Formula) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 570.8978740157480161 Td
(Effective Attendance Rate \(%\):) Tj
T* (EffectiveDenominator = Max\(1, TotalScheduledSessions - ExcusedSessions\)) Tj
T* (AttendancePct = Round\(\(AttendedSessions / EffectiveDenominator\) * 100\)) Tj
T* (Status is evaluated as:) Tj
T* (- MEETS_REQUIREMENT: AttendancePct >= Threshold \(Eligible for Final Exam\)) Tj
T* (- BELOW_REQUIREMENT: AttendancePct < Threshold and 0 Excused \(Debarred from Final Exam\)) Tj
T* (- REQUIRES_AUTHORIZED_REVIEW: AttendancePct < Threshold but ExcusedSessions > 0 \(Referred to HoD Committee\)) Tj
T* (- PENDING_EVALUATION: TotalSessions == 0 \(Incomplete data, never assumed to be 0%\)) Tj
ET
